# Fixed uid for the 'news' pseudo-recipient's mailbox (see
# virtual-news-mailbox). Must be >= virtual_minimum_uid (10000, see
# Containerfile) for virtual(8) to accept it, so it can't reuse the
# sub-10000 convention the (reverted) 'shared' pseudo-account used --
# 20000 is comfortably clear of the real, auto-incrementing per-user uid
# range that also starts at 10000
# (api-service/internal/store/schema.sql). No corresponding system
# account is needed: virtual(8) setuid()s to this numeric value
# directly, it never needs an /etc/passwd entry.
news	20000
